{"code":0, "message":"OK", "timestamp":"1785705694", "data":{"catalog":[{"id":"1", "name":"終末地百科", "status":2, "position":1, "typeSub":[{"id":"3", "name":"威脅", "fatherTypeId":"1", "style":2, "status":2, "position":8, "icon":"", "items":[{"itemId":"1115", "name":"阿萊克琉斯，千夫長", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260721/6525143125155/6a5f72bc337a11068196e968_2f76db19.png", "name":"阿萊克琉斯，千夫長", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10329"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10283"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10283", "10329"], "publishedAtTs":"1784643335", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"基石的造物。這位身經百戰的千夫長在超域中徘徊，直至失落的鋒刃被再次尋得，直至撕開那得以回歸的剎那。"}}]}, {"itemId":"1114", "name":"蝕影應龍隊長", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260721/6525143125155/6a5f729f9650be734250361e_2f76db19.png", "name":"蝕影應龍隊長", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10328"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10285"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10285", "10328"], "publishedAtTs":"1784643323", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"超域能量殘餘形成的實體，映照出了應龍隊長的形象。指揮能力、作戰能力、戰功……唯有百戰之兵，才有成為應龍隊長的機會。"}}]}, {"itemId":"1113", "name":"蝕影應龍破陣手", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260721/6525143125155/6a5f727c9650be734250361d_13673ac9.png", "name":"蝕影應龍破陣手", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10328"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10285"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10285", "10328"], "publishedAtTs":"1784643311", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"超域能量殘餘形成的實體，映照出了應龍破陣手的形象。極擅衝陣破障的應龍隊員，其手中的長柄刀是為了高效斬碎天使而設計。"}}]}, {"itemId":"1112", "name":"蝕影應龍尖兵", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260721/6525143125155/6a5f72479650be7342503619_f1525633.png", "name":"蝕影應龍尖兵", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10328"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10286"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10286", "10328"], "publishedAtTs":"1784643300", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"超域能量殘餘形成的實體，映照出了應龍尖兵的形象。在應龍之中，術劍皆通者，可稱尖兵。"}}]}, {"itemId":"1111", "name":"蝕影應龍前鋒", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260721/6525143125155/6a5f721f337a11068196e965_f1525633.png", "name":"蝕影應龍前鋒", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10328"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10286"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10286", "10328"], "publishedAtTs":"1784644410", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"超域能量殘餘形成的實體，映照出了應龍前鋒的形象。對應龍隊員來說，高超的近身格鬥技巧僅是基本功。"}}]}, {"itemId":"1110", "name":"蝕影噪雷", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260721/6525143125155/6a5f71f89650be7342503617_db193eac.png", "name":"蝕影噪雷", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10328"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10287"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10287", "10328"], "publishedAtTs":"1784644399", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"超域能量殘餘形成的實體，映照出了噪雷的形象。被寄養於談劍堂的牠曾是李織煙最好的朋友。此刻，這道「幻影」只有攻擊的本能。"}}]}, {"itemId":"1109", "name":"蝕影彪獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260721/6525143125155/6a5f71c19650be7342503616_2f76db19.png", "name":"蝕影彪獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10328"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10285"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10285", "10328"], "publishedAtTs":"1784643256", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"超域能量殘餘形成的實體，映照出了彪獸的形象。如無數隻眼睛一般的花紋擁有了更強的流動感，挪動之間足以攝人心魄。"}}]}, {"itemId":"1108", "name":"蝕影球刺獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260721/6525143125155/6a5f7193337a11068196e960_db193eac.png", "name":"蝕影球刺獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10328"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10284"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10284", "10328"], "publishedAtTs":"1784643247", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"超域能量殘餘形成的實體，映照出了球刺獸的形象。不知是否是錯覺，牠們滾動衝撞的姿態顯得更為狂暴。"}}]}, {"itemId":"1107", "name":"蝕影牙獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260721/6525143125155/6a5f70d8337a11068196e95c_2f76db19.png", "name":"蝕影牙獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10328"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10286"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10286", "10328"], "publishedAtTs":"1784643223", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"超域能量殘餘形成的實體，映照出了牙獸的形象。即便僅是一道「殘影」，牠們的尖牙利齒仍能撕裂防禦裝備。"}}]}, {"itemId":"1029", "name":"巨山犼獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260627/6525143125155/6a3f54f69650be73424fc8de_f1525633.png", "name":"巨山犼獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10269"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10287"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10287", "10269"], "publishedAtTs":"1782700019", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"山犼獸們的首領。在無數次的廝殺後，最強壯的山犼獸會成為族群首領，此時，牠已掌握了遠超普通獸類的戰鬥技巧。"}}]}, {"itemId":"1028", "name":"披甲裂獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260627/6525143125155/6a3f54ce9650be73424fc8dd_13673ac9.png", "name":"披甲裂獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10269"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10285"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10285", "10269"], "publishedAtTs":"1782700014", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"在塔衛二演化出的特殊裂獸，身上披著極厚的鱗甲，與山犼獸存在互利共生關係……偵察兵與攻堅手，配合無間的好夥伴。"}}]}, {"itemId":"1027", "name":"山犼獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260627/6525143125155/6a3f5487337a110681967bf1_6ad0f152.png", "name":"山犼獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10269"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10286"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10286", "10269"], "publishedAtTs":"1782700010", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"自然環境中的山犼獸。這些聰慧且調皮的動物甚至會布置「險境」，牠們喜歡看到人類氣急敗壞的樣子，請務必平心靜氣應對。"}}]}, {"itemId":"990", "name":"天鼓", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260524/6525143125155/6a12c872337a11068195e2e5_db193eac.png", "name":"天鼓", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10269"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10287"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10287", "10269"], "publishedAtTs":"1779632649", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"自然環境中的咆獸，是塔衛二的原生動物。頭部及頸部的堅韌皮膜能讓牠發出震動山林的巨大吼聲。"}}]}, {"itemId":"868", "name":"聶菲斯，「征服者」", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260511/7975743702697/6a00e19a337a11068195a9ec_f1525633.png", "name":"聶菲斯，「征服者」", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10283"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10283", "10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1778653680", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"征服者的心象，她毫不掩飾自己肆虐文明的欲望。"}}]}, {"itemId":"867", "name":"聶菲斯，「碾骨」", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260511/7975743702697/6a00e057337a11068195a9ea_db193eac.png", "name":"聶菲斯，「碾骨」", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10283"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10283", "10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1778653684", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「碾骨」之名因聶菲斯而響徹環帶。她的殘暴征途從未結束，她的野心也尚未展露。"}}]}, {"itemId":"866", "name":"表象", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260509/7975743702697/69ff3c0d337a11068195a398_6ad0f152.png", "name":"表象", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10269"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10286"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10286", "10269"], "publishedAtTs":"1778653688", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"應阿達希爾召喚而來的幻影，昔日毀滅的表象，舊日凋亡的沉積。"}}]}, {"itemId":"751", "name":"阮一", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260322/6525143125155/69bf74bec58d404e53cf5a77_6ad0f152.png", "name":"阮一", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10260"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10283"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10283", "10260"], "publishedAtTs":"1774970099", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"在長久的煎熬後，在稍縱即逝的「機會」前，阮一不再壓抑心中的火焰。"}}]}, {"itemId":"741", "name":"開天將", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260322/6525143125155/69bf74e87c2305399ff6c609_6ad0f152.png", "name":"開天將", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10260"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10285"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10285", "10260"], "publishedAtTs":"1774970094", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備了重型武器的非法武裝人員。開天難成，一眾背負四聯裝發射器的武裝人員中，只有足夠強者才能獲得「開天」之名。"}}]}, {"itemId":"740", "name":"摧山將", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260322/6525143125155/69bf752404c7f0cc11674964_13673ac9.png", "name":"摧山將", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10260"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10285"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10285", "10260"], "publishedAtTs":"1774970088", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備了重型武器的非法武裝人員。撼山不易，但摧山將的四聯裝發射器是貨真價實的重火力，萬不可掉以輕心。"}}]}, {"itemId":"739", "name":"斷雲叟", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260322/6525143125155/69bf79b27c2305399ff6c616_6ad0f152.png", "name":"斷雲叟", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10260"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10285"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10285", "10260"], "publishedAtTs":"1774970081", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備了奇異兵器的非法武裝人員。劫雲客中擅使勾刃的好手，據說技巧精湛到能把雲霧切成方方正正的一塊。"}}]}, {"itemId":"738", "name":"割雲翁", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260322/6525143125155/69bf797bc58d404e53cf5a83_13673ac9.png", "name":"割雲翁", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10260"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10284"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10284", "10260"], "publishedAtTs":"1774970075", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備了奇異兵器的非法武裝人員。當劫雲客厭倦了使用手上的奇異燈籠對敵，便會取出短刃，與敵人近身搏殺。"}}]}, {"itemId":"737", "name":"劫雲客", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260322/6525143125155/69bf79ec7c2305399ff6c617_2f76db19.png", "name":"劫雲客", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10260"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10284"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10284", "10260"], "publishedAtTs":"1774970069", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備了奇異兵器的非法武裝人員。劫雲客的兵器形似燈籠，看似無害，但十步之外便足以取人首級，不得大意。"}}]}, {"itemId":"736", "name":"過堂風", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260322/6525143125155/69bf7a0fc58d404e53cf5a84_6ad0f152.png", "name":"過堂風", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10260"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10286"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10286", "10260"], "publishedAtTs":"1774970063", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備了基礎遠程武器的非法武裝人員。眼力更強，雙手更巧。一箭破門，穿堂過室，捲走幾多錢財。"}}]}, {"itemId":"735", "name":"莫惜命", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260322/6525143125155/69bf7a3704c7f0cc1167496f_f1525633.png", "name":"莫惜命", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10260"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10286"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10286", "10260"], "publishedAtTs":"1774970055", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"在武陵轄地上活動的非法武裝人員。他們透過私設關卡、走私違禁品牟取利益，個別暴徒甚至會威脅到路人性命。"}}]}, {"itemId":"689", "name":"白堊附肢", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697151f95086e19cbe3e0fc5.png", "name":"白堊附肢", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1770294272", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"未歸檔。因形成特徵，推定為天使。外觀上自本體延伸而出，實則由形成位置延伸至本體，推定此為擾敵策略。"}}]}, {"itemId":"688", "name":"白堊界衛", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260226/5037219876433/69a047ad15b3735df6b1381c_6ad0f152.png", "name":"白堊界衛", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}, {"subTypeId":"10282", "value":"10283"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10283", "10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769034314", "caption":[{"bold":true, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"白堊界衛"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"是《明日方舟：終末地》中的一類"}}, {"bold":true, "kind":"text", "text":{"text":"領袖敵人"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"。"}}]}, {"itemId":"687", "name":"焚霧源石蟲", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697151dc2911efa230ad9171.png", "name":"焚霧源石蟲", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769034320", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"野生的被感染生物，體溫極高，背部甲殼所含源石粉塵活性更強，強烈建議不要靠近這團活體岩漿。"}}]}, {"itemId":"686", "name":"火霧源石蟲", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697151c9d09866eeaf56aa37.png", "name":"火霧源石蟲", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769034328", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"野生的被感染生物，體溫極高。牠在瀕死時會發生爆炸，沸騰的酸性體液與活性源石粉塵將襲捲周邊的一切。"}}]}, {"itemId":"496", "name":"破潮之像", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/6971519765ffe70e9535fc0c.png", "name":"破潮之像", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769034406", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「阿納伐克呂丹」（歸檔編號：AGM32L），AGM321的非模式種，個體大小並不統一。大型個體破浪而出的姿態留在了許多人的噩夢中。"}}]}, {"itemId":"431", "name":"「碾骨之拳」羅丹", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69715146e3acca11e53da782.png", "name":"「碾骨之拳」羅丹", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769034413", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"聶菲斯的「右手」，碾骨氏族頭號戰將。曾有許多裂地者試圖挑戰聶菲斯的權威，他們的野心被羅丹以重拳逐一粉碎。"}}]}, {"itemId":"430", "name":"碾骨破城者", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69715137c15709c5bd08c124.png", "name":"碾骨破城者", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769034419", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備重型爆破拳甲的裂地者武裝人員。是碾骨氏族的主力作戰人員，其手臂上佩戴的武器是一種小型攻城兵器。"}}]}, {"itemId":"429", "name":"碾骨先鋒", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/6971511b4e40f4ca8347a638.png", "name":"碾骨先鋒", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769034424", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備矛與盾的裂地者武裝人員。簡陋的拼接裝備反而讓碾骨先鋒鍛鍊出了攻防一體的戰鬥技巧，請小心應對。"}}]}, {"itemId":"428", "name":"精銳行刑人", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69715107859d9d5c90cf7793.png", "name":"精銳行刑人", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769034430", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"受霧火強化，裝備重型斬擊斧的裂地者精銳武裝人員，體型高大。他們通常是碾骨氏族襲掠隊伍的首領。"}}]}, {"itemId":"427", "name":"精銳撕裂牙獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697150f9133439cd5afffc02.png", "name":"精銳撕裂牙獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769034436", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"受霧火強化，由裂地者武裝人員操縱的精銳戰獸。比普通的牙獸更加殘暴狡詐，行為詭異、難以預料。"}}]}, {"itemId":"426", "name":"精銳伏擊射手", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697150e80920b30f43778eec.png", "name":"精銳伏擊射手", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769034441", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"受霧火強化，裝備遠程武器的裂地者精銳武裝人員。他們訓練有素，射擊精準，使用的弩箭得到了全面強化。"}}]}, {"itemId":"425", "name":"精銳劫掠者", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697150d9479fef709c2c335f.png", "name":"精銳劫掠者", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769034445", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"受霧火強化，裝備近戰武器的裂地者精銳武裝人員。他們的裝備、體能與白刃戰技術得到了全面強化。"}}]}, {"itemId":"424", "name":"霧火牙獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697150c4c9b3cd796e6b9165.png", "name":"霧火牙獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769034450", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"浸染霧火的牙獸。當這種詭異的小型危險生物成群行動時，能對全副武裝的外勤小隊造成巨大的威脅。"}}]}, {"itemId":"423", "name":"碾骨撕裂牙獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697150adc15709c5bd08c123.png", "name":"碾骨撕裂牙獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769034456", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"由裂地者武裝人員操縱的小型戰獸。遠比自然環境中的牙獸更加兇猛殘暴，絕對忠誠於馴養牠們的裂地者。"}}]}, {"itemId":"422", "name":"霧火爪牙", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69715096dd3a6edec975eef7.png", "name":"霧火爪牙", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769034461", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"浸染霧火的裂地者武裝人員。汲取霧火並不一定是一件幸運的事，這些裂地者遭到了嚴重的扭曲。"}}]}, {"itemId":"421", "name":"碾骨滲透者", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/6971507ee868cec3d80812bb.png", "name":"碾骨滲透者", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769034466", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備成對近戰武器的裂地者武裝人員。會熟練地運用雙持武器作戰，行動敏捷，擅長近身纏鬥，必須謹慎應對。"}}]}, {"itemId":"420", "name":"碾骨射手", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714fabb24c2cc3c2097779.png", "name":"碾骨射手", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769033722", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備重型遠程武器的裂地者武裝人員。他們是伏擊射手中脫穎而出的精英，沉重的箭矢足以貫穿身著重甲的目標。"}}]}, {"itemId":"419", "name":"碾骨清道夫", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714f92e3acca11e53da77f.png", "name":"碾骨清道夫", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769033730", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備火焰噴射器的裂地者武裝人員。他們使用造型粗劣但工藝精良的焚化裝備，清掃堅固的掩體與頑固的抵抗者。"}}]}, {"itemId":"418", "name":"碾骨焰術師", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714f7c41855c182ecdc2ea.png", "name":"碾骨焰術師", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769033736", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"掌握源石技藝的裂地者武裝人員。他們操縱塑能轉換系源石技藝，在戰場上播撒烈焰，是不折不扣的高威脅目標。"}}]}, {"itemId":"417", "name":"碾骨行刑人", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714f630920b30f43778eeb.png", "name":"碾骨行刑人", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769033745", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備重型斬擊斧的裂地者武裝人員，體型高大。他們的體能強於多數裂地者，能掀翻戰車，甚至輕鬆破壞工事。"}}]}, {"itemId":"416", "name":"蓄能球刺獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714f488230f1b03cc50b56.png", "name":"蓄能球刺獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769033751", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"受到活性源石粉塵影響的球刺獸。其身體上下的尖刺中已儲存了相當多的能量，擁有了更強的破壞力。"}}]}, {"itemId":"415", "name":"霧火斧甲獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714f337c0413b3124ca69d.png", "name":"霧火斧甲獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769033756", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"浸染霧火的斧甲獸，性情變得極度暴躁，已經進入了一種瘋癲狀態，如果不想體驗被「巨斧」劈成兩半的感覺，請小心應對。"}}]}, {"itemId":"414", "name":"怒目彪獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714f21303281de3f0750d5.png", "name":"怒目彪獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769033762", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"彪獸的特殊變異色型，壽命有所減少，但個體更為強壯。其像眼睛一樣的花紋更為炫目，彷彿液態的火焰。"}}]}, {"itemId":"413", "name":"酸液源石蟲·α", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714f06a1c4dd69df7d6b49.png", "name":"酸液源石蟲·α", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769033767", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"野生的被感染生物，比一般酸液源石蟲更具有威脅性。其背上的源石晶簇正逐漸活性化，使其攻擊性更強。"}}]}, {"itemId":"412", "name":"殘暴原生鉗獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714e4da468ebd6138567a3.png", "name":"殘暴原生鉗獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769033351", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"野生的被感染生物，背上有著大量源石晶簇，體型巨大。甲殼比普通鉗獸更厚，背上的源石晶簇活性更強。"}}]}, {"itemId":"410", "name":"水燈蟲", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714e33484c700e816d22e9.png", "name":"水燈蟲", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769033359", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"自然環境中的水棲昆蟲，能夠發出微光。牠腹腔內的刺激性體液會引發皮膚過敏並造成灼傷，小心應對。"}}]}, {"itemId":"409", "name":"球刺獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714e1d6c326a83dea2ec27.png", "name":"球刺獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769033364", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"自然環境中的球刺獸，是塔衛二的原生動物。在牠豎起自身的尖刺滾動起來後，有著不輸電鋸的破壞力。"}}]}, {"itemId":"408", "name":"百眼彪獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714dfebc25979e2269276f.png", "name":"百眼彪獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769033370", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"自然環境中的彪獸，是塔衛二的原生動物。彪獸身上的特殊花紋如同無數隻眼睛，在狩獵時能夠震懾獵物。"}}]}, {"itemId":"407", "name":"酸液源石蟲", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/6971471b133439cd5afffbff.png", "name":"酸液源石蟲", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769031528", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"野生的被感染生物，能分泌酸性物質。在受到威脅時會劇烈抖動自身，將背上的源石晶簇抛射出去，恐嚇敵人。"}}]}, {"itemId":"406", "name":"原生鉗獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697146e7d09e72e95f958cbb.png", "name":"原生鉗獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769031535", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"野生的被感染生物，背上有著大量源石晶簇，體型巨大。能夠用鐮刀般的前肢撕開獵物。"}}]}, {"itemId":"405", "name":"斧甲獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697146c041855c182ecdc2e6.png", "name":"斧甲獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769031542", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"自然環境中的野生斧甲獸，身披骨甲。在衝鋒狀態下，其斧狀巨角甚至能破開厚重的合金門。"}}]}, {"itemId":"404", "name":"潛地虯獸", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697146b31d54a250d5f452cb.png", "name":"潛地虯獸", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":[], "publishedAtTs":"1769031550", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"能夠噴吐強力腐蝕性液體的野獸，大部分時間會潛於地下。牠會以酸液腐蝕金屬，並將其吞入腹中，因此與牠們交戰時需要保護好武器。"}}]}, {"itemId":"403", "name":"穿林箭", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697146500920b30f43778ee8.png", "name":"穿林箭", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10260"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10260"], "publishedAtTs":"1769031557", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備了基礎遠程武器的非法武裝人員。他的箭術在竹林中練就，一箭穿林，不沾片葉。"}}]}, {"itemId":"402", "name":"莫留財", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697146344e40f4ca8347a634.png", "name":"莫留財", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10260"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10260"], "publishedAtTs":"1769031563", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"活動在宏山轄地上的非法武裝人員。他們透過私設關卡，走私違禁品牟取利益，是宏山治安力量的重要打擊對象。"}}]}, {"itemId":"401", "name":"白堊界衛", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697145f83aee85a90709d82b.png", "name":"白堊界衛", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769031575", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"未歸檔。因形成特徵，推定為天使。牠的形成模式經過了重組，卻仍在模仿聶菲斯的外形。所有進一步推定結論均判斷為不可靠。"}}]}, {"itemId":"400", "name":"三位一體", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714577859d9d5c90cf778e.png", "name":"三位一體", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769031581", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"未歸檔。因形成特徵，推定為天使。光環形態的變化可能是決策能力的表現。警告，觀測到其具有錨點屬性。"}}]}, {"itemId":"399", "name":"潮行天使δ", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697143e6133439cd5afffbfc.png", "name":"潮行天使δ", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769030800", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「傑那克呂丹·狄涅同」（歸檔編號：AGM321δ），AGM321的激流種。內部構成物質流轉激烈，在夜間出現時，其外形會顯得尤為恐怖。"}}]}, {"itemId":"398", "name":"晶錐天使δ", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697143bcd09e72e95f958cba.png", "name":"晶錐天使δ", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769030809", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「戴法斯塔格蘭·狄涅同」（歸檔編號：ARM3158），ARM315的激流種。在日照下會發出璀璨的紫光，在塔羅斯的反光照射下則是另一副模樣。"}}]}, {"itemId":"397", "name":"濁流天使δ", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/6971435aef4126b3c2040e30.png", "name":"濁流天使δ", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769030815", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「托雷格蘭·狄涅同」（歸檔編號：ACM3118），ACM311的激流種。對能量的運用形式特殊，內部溫度明顯低於構成物質的冰點。"}}]}, {"itemId":"396", "name":"潮行天使", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697143146c326a83dea2ec26.png", "name":"潮行天使", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769030855", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「傑那克呂丹」（歸檔編號：AGM321），其頭部和腿部具有類人特徵，從這種形成模式的發現開始，是否類人成為了判斷天使強度的一條不成文標準。"}}]}, {"itemId":"395", "name":"稜鏡天使", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697142ccba9a40b68bcda6ba.png", "name":"稜鏡天使", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769030871", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「普里瑪塔格蘭」（歸檔編號：ASM316），ARM315的非模式種，能夠為周圍的天使提供保護，混雜在ARM315中時會很難擊中"}}, {"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"牠。"}}]}, {"itemId":"394", "name":"晶錐天使", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/6971429a303281de3f0750d1.png", "name":"晶錐天使", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769030863", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「戴法斯塔格蘭」（歸檔編號：ARM315），投擲能量的液體形成模式，擁有複雜對稱的幾何外形，牠的攻擊會從接觸面奪走熱量。"}}]}, {"itemId":"393", "name":"濁流天使", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69714262bc25979e22692768.png", "name":"濁流天使", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769030879", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「托雷格蘭」（歸檔編號：ACM311），是人類發現的第一種使用液體的形成模式，光環的外觀不穩定，內部溫度通常比構成物質本身低。"}}]}, {"itemId":"392", "name":"跂步晶城", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697142230920b30f43778ee4.png", "name":"跂步晶城", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769030916", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「圖利奧隆」（歸檔編號：ACL156），光環被正面盾牌形結構完全保護的形成模式，能夠使用能量將遠處的目標拖動至身前，需要小心。"}}]}, {"itemId":"391", "name":"碾骨伏擊射手", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/6971408447aad8c833daeff9.png", "name":"碾骨伏擊射手", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769029879", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備基礎遠程武器的裂地者武裝人員。他們僅受過基礎的射擊訓練，準度不佳，但仍有許多人命喪於他們的弩箭。"}}]}, {"itemId":"390", "name":"仿生翅天使α", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/6971404bef4126b3c2040e2d.png", "name":"仿生翅天使α", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769029887", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「蘇索泰隆·阿納翁」（歸檔編號：ARA07Cα），ARAO7C的激發種。通常認為牠與原形成模式的區別只有顏色。"}}]}, {"itemId":"389", "name":"仿生翅天使", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/697140273aee85a90709d827.png", "name":"仿生翅天使", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769029898", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「蘇索泰隆」（歸檔編號：ARA07C），飛行能力與其外形無關。這種形成模式最早被認為是對生物的模仿，但如今，認知已演變為模仿泰拉人所使用的飛行器。"}}]}, {"itemId":"388", "name":"碾骨劫掠者", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69713fffe868cec3d80812b3.png", "name":"碾骨劫掠者", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10259"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10259"], "publishedAtTs":"1769029908", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"裝備基礎近戰武器的裂地者武裝人員。他們是組成裂地者團體的「大多數」，裝備簡陋，但常常成群出現。"}}]}, {"itemId":"387", "name":"肖像天使", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69713fbff47b48c6aa787b70.png", "name":"肖像天使", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769029915", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「歐墨薩隆」（歸檔編號：AGL371），具有模仿人類軀體或某個部位的形成模式，罕見而危險。部分個體能引導超域能量。"}}]}, {"itemId":"386", "name":"崗哨天使", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69713f98e3acca11e53da778.png", "name":"崗哨天使", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769029924", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「弗洛薩隆」（歸檔編號：ARS316），形成模式被認為在模仿人類的哨戒炮。射程遠，但形成後從不移動。"}}]}, {"itemId":"385", "name":"重刺天使α", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69713f63519331a97920f953.png", "name":"重刺天使α", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769029931", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「華麗肯托隆·阿納翁」（歸檔編號：ARL141α），ARL141的激發種。保留了原本多變的攻擊方式，提高了形成模式的堅固度，危險。"}}]}, {"itemId":"384", "name":"剛角天使α", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69713f3ef787d1fc599d9b5b.png", "name":"剛角天使α", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769029938", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「提利索隆·阿納翁」（歸檔編號：ACL072α），ACL072的激發種。其具有的高能量並沒有影響到決策能力，較為危險。"}}]}, {"itemId":"383", "name":"釘刺天使α", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69713e34e9a3e4b7c53d5d32.png", "name":"釘刺天使α", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769029316", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「肯托隆·阿納翁」（歸檔編號：ARL121α），ARL121的激發種。單純靠更高的能量密度來提高火力，能量利用效率仍然很低。"}}]}, {"itemId":"382", "name":"大角天使α", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69713df9a1c4dd69df7d6b3e.png", "name":"大角天使α", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769029324", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「克利俄松·阿納翁」（歸檔編號：ACL071α），ACL071的激發種。溢出的能量給了牠們標誌性的亮紅外觀，比模式種更為堅固、靈活。"}}]}, {"itemId":"381", "name":"重刺天使", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69713dc7682c1955b86382cd.png", "name":"重刺天使", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769029341", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「華麗肯托隆」（歸檔編號：ARL141），ARL121的非模式種。有時會放棄能量攻擊，直接用尾巴近戰。"}}]}, {"itemId":"380", "name":"釘刺天使", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69713da165ffe70e9535fc03.png", "name":"釘刺天使", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769029334", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「肯托隆」（歸檔編號：ARL121），能夠從自身構成物質賦予能量並以慣性方法將能量投出。能量的利用效率很低。"}}]}, {"itemId":"379", "name":"剛角天使", "lang":"zh_Hant", "brief":{"cover":"https://static.skport.com/image/rm42wiki/20260122/3622104429312/69713d6ae3acca11e53da775.png", "name":"剛角天使", "description":null, "associate":null, "dotType":"", "subTypeList":[{"subTypeId":"10258", "value":"10261"}], "composite":null, "disableCoverShowInDetail":false}, "status":2, "tagIds":["10261"], "publishedAtTs":"1769029348", "caption":[{"kind":"text", "text":{"text":"「提利索隆」（歸檔編號：ACL072），ACL071的非模式種。牠們能夠利用周圍環境，表現出一定的決策能力。"}}]}, {"itemId":"378", "name":"大角天使", "lang"